{"parse": {"title": "Cool Star", "pageid": 4961, "revid": 36369, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/52/Cool_star.png/revision/latest?cb=20231026054836\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"cool star\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/52/Cool_star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20231026054836\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"102\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Cool star.png\" data-image-key=\"Cool_star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Cool_star.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">cool star</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Cool Star</b>, added in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 17</a>, is a reward obtained from reaching Room 100 in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> (10th Season).\n</p><p>As of 18/11/23, the day of <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 18</a>, and the end of Season 10, the Cool Star could be opened to receive <a href=\"/wiki/Fridge\" title=\"Fridge\">Fridge</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Required to obtain a special unit...</span></li>\n<li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#921296;\"><i>\"Finished already? Where's all that bravado?\"</i></span></li>\n<li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#fc4242;\">This Star is sealed with a powerful magic and cannot be opened yet...</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Mythic)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fridge\" title=\"Fridge\"><img alt=\"Fridge\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/66/Fridge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20231119045903\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"98\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Fridge.png\" data-image-key=\"Fridge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Fridge</div></dd>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022064128\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 129/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1436/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 368/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.057/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 6142187/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   75.195      1 Template:Container_Characterbox\n100.00%   75.195      1 -total\n 98.23%   73.86